    {
      "id": "claim_0f5b364e416f4fcf9f0456587627cb4e",
      "statement": "ddpui/celery.py is the single source of Celery config: the broker, result backend and RedBeat beat each use a separate Redis DB index from RedisDB (0 broker, 1 beat, 2 results), while Channels uses DB 3 and the app cache (task progress, auth caches) uses DB 4.",
