    {
      "id": "claim_d27be47f22024835a86a4ed15edaca96",
      "statement": "Beat uses redbeat.RedBeatScheduler with schedule state in Redis DB 1, and the periodic schedule is registered in setup_periodic_tasks (on_after_finalize) in celeryworkers/tasks.py, covering schema-change detection, canvas lock cleanup, alert dispatch every 60s, stuck-lock clearing every 300s, 6-hourly flow-run sync, hourly trial emails/deletion, daily Airbyte stats sync and monthly audit-log purge; long-running flow-run checks are registered only if ADMIN_EMAIL is set.",
      "evidence": [
