      "id": "claim_b92719e6cf574614b1f821d7cb64cb97",
      "statement": "The webapp polls task progress with SWR hooks that hit /api/tasks/{id}?hashkey=<prefix>-<orgSlug> or /api/tasks/stp/{key} and stop refreshing once the last progress entry is completed or failed; the schema-catalog websocket consumer instead loops every 2 seconds on SingleTaskProgress.fetch and reuses an existing live key to avoid starting a duplicate task.",
