    {
      "id": "claim_3b2d9fd150e94b74b97ba4c35ea00dda",
      "statement": "do_handle_prefect_webhook re-fetches the flow run from Prefect; for deployment runs, terminal states delete TaskLocks for that flow_run_id and upsert PrefectFlowRun (with optional single retry of failed/crashed runs gated by PREFECT_RETRY_CRASHED_FLOW_RUNS), pending state locks the deployment's tasks as the system user and stamps the flow_run_id, and running upserts the run; failure notifications go to org managers and optionally platform admins, with errors swallowed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/core/webhooks/webhook_functions.py#L138-L210",
