      "statement": "TaskLock is a Postgres row (one per OrgTask) that prevents concurrent runs: lock_tasks_for_deployment raises HTTP 400 if any lock exists and creates all locks atomically; locks are released on terminal webhook states, by run_dbt_commands in its finally block, or by clear_stuck_locks.",
