    {
      "id": "claim_7a9fbb72d77649c0a60a6b4f8f531019",
      "statement": "clear_stuck_locks runs every 300s: for each flow_run_id holding locks it deletes locks if Prefect no longer knows the run, and if the run is terminal for at least 300 seconds (end_time, falling back to updated) it re-invokes do_handle_prefect_webhook; younger or unparseable runs are skipped and per-run errors are logged, making it the safety net for lost webhooks.",
